  Pfadgespräche — the GERMAN counterpart of p01 (de-DE).

  Part of the four-language expansion (it / fr / de / pt) added 2026-10-01, after `es` proved the
  shape. The CONTENT is parallel to p01_e01 and p10_e01 — the same trail-building conversation,
  the same three sponsor reads — so a translation of this episode can be compared against a known
  meaning, and anything the pipeline does differently across the five is attributable to LANGUAGE
  rather than to subject matter.

  The PEOPLE are this show's own, and that is deliberate. Reusing Maya and Liam Verbeek across
  every language would have put one host on seven feeds, and `person:maya` spanning shows is the
  precision-failure signal the capability audit exists to surface — real at three feeds, noise at
  seven.

  Voices: nur eine deutsche Stimme (Anna), durch Tonhöhe getrennt. The measured F0 table and the reasoning behind each pitch factor live in
  tests/fixtures/scripts/transcripts_to_mp3.py. Verified against the real pyannote service: this
  audio diarizes into THREE speakers, which is what the transcript declares.

  `de` is ENABLED in config/languages.yaml, so this feed is one the pipeline processes.
-->
